"""Walk-through of lesson 33, Authorization.

Example numbers (mine, checked by script): 1,000,000 orders in the system, Alice's company (Acme) owns 12.
A script at 100 requests a second reads all 1,000,000 ids in 10,000 s = 2.8 h. Profile: 8 fields, 3 on the allow-list.
200 queries in the app, 1 forgets its WHERE. Roles: 500 users x 4 permissions = 2,000 grants; 3 roles + 500 assignments = 503 entries; 300 editors.
Team access: 3 facts answer the question; leaving the team deletes 1 fact instead of 40 grants. 20 services, 1 policy.
Export service: 30 tables and 12 buckets under the admin account; after least privilege 1 view of 4 columns and 1 bucket.
Exports bucket: 5,000 files, 200 companies, 25 each. Audit log: 1,000 reads a day x 365 = 365,000 entries x 200 B = 73 MB a year.
"""
